ł internetu. Ochrona, kara do 1200 zł i nerwy w pakiecie.","chance":60,"success":{"media":4,"nextFight":1},"successText":"Ochrona was rozdziela, Kurek krzyczy coś, czego nikt nie słyszy. Ty stoisz spokojnie i poprawiasz bluzę. Na zdjęciach wygląda to tak, jakbyś już wygrał.","fail":{"money":-1200,"rep":-2,"nextFight":-1},"failText":"Ktoś kogoś popycha, ktoś leci na stół z mikrofonami. Federacja liczy ci 1200 zł kary i pisze o „wartościach”. Trener nie odzywa się do ciebie do wieczora."},{"label":"Wyciągasz rękę","desc":"Szacunek przy kamerach. Jak nie poda, to on wyjdzie na buca.","effects":{"rep":2}}]}},"press":null},"lastSummary":{"season":3,"year":2028,"age":18,"tier":1,"fed":"Armada Fight Night Gdańsk","club":"Sparta Fight Club","w":1,"l":3,"d":0,"rank":null,"champion":false,"beltWon":false,"moneyDelta":5600,"moneyFights":4700,"legacyFrom":91,"legacyTo":152,"ovrFrom":33,"ovrTo":36,"form":"Dobra forma","grade":"Rok do zapomnienia","bars":[{"label":"Wyniki","value":25,"note":"wygrane: 1 z 4"},{"label":"Na tle oczekiwań","value":39,"note":"poniżej możliwości"},{"label":"Bilans kasy","value":78,"note":"+6 tys. zł po kosztach"},{"label":"Forma","value":65,"note":"dobra forma"}],"story":"Bilans roku: 1-3. Pierwsze starcie z nowym rywalem (Krystian Wiśniewski): przegrany. Bartosz Duda dalej trzyma pas, już 2 lata z rzędu.","outside":[{"icon":"phone","label":"Obserwujący","value":"+129 (razem 12 tys.)"},{"icon":"ticket","label":"Bilety","value":"243 bilety, prowizja 4850 zł"}]},"market":null,"flags":{"amLevel":1,"tryoutPending":0,"luxV2":1,"amLocal":1,"tryout":1,"ovrStart":36,"moneyStart":34200,"yearStarted:1":1,"jobYear":0,"formBonus":0,"amLocalSeasons":1,"nextFightMod":1,"bestStreak":5,"amPromote":0,"sideTired":0,"legacyPrev":152,"doubleActive":0,"debt":0,"cut":0,"yearStarted:2":1,"rivalPick":1,"peerWins":1,"splitLoss":1,"titleCall":0,"callUp":0,"superCall":0,"interim":0,"superLoss":0,"debutAdvance":1,"yearStarted:3":1,"gala:Armada Fight Night Gdańsk":27,"cevn:guru":1